  "title": "Easy Chili",
  "description": "This easy chili is a snap to make with beef, bell peppers, tomatoes, spices, and beans in a large pot. Kick things up a notch with fresh jalapeños.",
  "authors": [
    "Danielle Spivey"
  ],
